WEBVTT

00:44:29.015 --> 00:44:31.467
stand your ground
for the things that matter to you,

00:44:31.491 --> 00:44:33.131
because that will travel with you.

00:44:33.155 --> 00:44:39.272
(Music)

00:44:40.453 --> 00:44:42.629
AG: As WeWork's IPO
was collapsing last fall

00:44:42.653 --> 00:44:45.073
and several thousand
people were being laid off,

00:44:45.097 --> 00:44:48.012
Dave stood his ground
for something that mattered to him.

00:44:48.036 --> 00:44:51.017
He tweeted that he was willing to serve
as a personal reference

00:44:51.041 --> 00:44:53.171
for anyone at the company.

00:44:54.796 --> 00:44:57.848
The post-mortem on WeWork
has only just begun,

00:44:57.872 --> 00:44:59.130
but my biggest takeaway

00:44:59.154 --> 00:45:01.194
is that we should all
be a little skeptical